 "remarks": "This beautifully renovated home welcomes you the moment you step inside! With a private entrance and 900 sq ft of living space, this sunny garden level condo in the highly desirable Rowayton Woods complex combines comfort, convenience and style! The bright east-facing kitchen is newly renovated with extended cabinet storage, undermount sink, new range and quartz counters. The living room/dining room offers new light fixtures, new recessed lighting, new flooring, new window treatments. A Nest system has been added to the HVAC for additional ease and convenience. The bath is also newly renovated and the whole unit has been freshly painted. The bedroom features new flooring and ample closet space. Additionally, there is walk in storage in the laundry area.  Rowayton Woods is known for its beautifully maintained grounds, and wonderful amenities, including a heated in-ground pool, pool house, tennis court, and community garden area-creating one of the most serene and sought after condo settings in town! Located just minutes from the Rowayton Train Station, shops, schools, and downtown Rowayton, this home offers the perfect blend of tranquility and convenience. Reserved parking directly in front of the unit.",
